#: ../../diagrams-guide.md:1 3864fa7224f74483a017e530797d3a6b
msgid "Appendix-03: Diagram Quick Reference"
msgstr "附录-03：图表速查"

#: ../../diagrams-guide.md:5 247c5fd875674a85a58f4d1fbc2694c2
msgid ""
"Mermaid is the primary diagramming tool for PKB documentation. This page "
"covers the most common diagram types. For additional examples (class "
"diagrams, ER diagrams, Gantt charts), refer to the Mermaid documentation at "
"<https://mermaid.js.org/intro/>."
msgstr ""
"Mermaid 是知识库文档的主要图表工具。本页介绍最常见的图表类型。更多示例（类图、ER 图、甘特图）请参阅 Mermaid "
"文档：<https://mermaid.js.org/intro/>。"

#: ../../diagrams-guide.md:7 ab53bc0518554fd1bf940094c4e120e4
msgid "Flowcharts"
msgstr "流程图"

#: ../../diagrams-guide.md:22 df7f07ca80e44c3ea0982ebe30f89acb
msgid "Sequence Diagrams"
msgstr "时序图"

#: ../../diagrams-guide.md:45 87edc64acee34494ae2e6e8fa961d855
msgid "C4 Context Diagram"
msgstr "C4 上下文图"

#: ../../diagrams-guide.md:56 5d703bfe91ac4a6f843375ddcdf1e13c
msgid "State Diagrams"
msgstr "状态图"

#: ../../diagrams-guide.md:71 3754cc9b47144c80851cef25a711a82b
msgid "Tips"
msgstr "技巧"

#: ../../diagrams-guide.md:73 4b2a0a34485b491ea6ff1d01b5184daf
msgid ""
"Use `flowchart TD` (top-down) or `flowchart LR` (left-right) for "
"architecture and process diagrams."
msgstr "架构和流程图中使用 `flowchart TD`（自上而下）或 `flowchart LR`（从左到右）。"

#: ../../diagrams-guide.md:74 ccb84e0cae27451f9d759eb72c46e95c
msgid "Use `sequenceDiagram` for runtime call chains and API interactions."
msgstr "运行时调用链和 API 交互使用 `sequenceDiagram`。"

#: ../../diagrams-guide.md:75 792957ee3c8e4228887425006b63b6dc
msgid "Use `stateDiagram-v2` for lifecycle and state machine documentation."
msgstr "生命周期和状态机文档使用 `stateDiagram-v2`。"

#: ../../diagrams-guide.md:76 301e120e16384499bd85dc3f4b440a9f
msgid ""
"Prefer Mermaid over PlantUML -- it renders natively in Sphinx via "
"`sphinxcontrib-mermaid`."
msgstr "相比 PlantUML 更推荐 Mermaid——它通过 `sphinxcontrib-mermaid` 在 Sphinx 中原生渲染。"

#: ../../diagrams-guide.md:77 f0f78337cff04d1e82ce73ab030f8ed4
msgid "Keep diagrams focused: one concept per diagram, not the entire system."
msgstr "保持图表聚焦：每个图表表达一个概念，而不是整个系统。"
